  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">허접합니다.&#160;<span data-ke-size=\"size16\">하하하</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">유치하구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이게 뭔 소용인가 싶은데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그래도 모형도 못 만져봐...과자도 못먹어...스티커는 사이즈 나눠주다 수업 끝나겠다싶어서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>그냥 <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">대충</span> 만들어보았습니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99196D345EFDA1E318\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99196D345EFDA1E318\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>A4 1장</b></span>을 출력해서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997E71345EFDA1E41B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997E71345EFDA1E41B\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">점선을 접어 <span style=\"color: #0055ff;\"><b>자릅니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B236345EFDA1E420\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B236345EFDA1E420\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff007f;\"><b>팝업</b></span>되게요 ㅋㅋ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99802F345EFDA1E41B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99802F345EFDA1E41B\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">요렇게~!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99AF79345EFDA1E520\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99AF79345EFDA1E520\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이것도 <span style=\"color: #1fda11;\"><b>파봅니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995667345EFDA1E517\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995667345EFDA1E517\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #e545d0;\"><b>자르기</b></span> 끝~!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994DF1345EFDA1E511\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994DF1345EFDA1E511\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #4673ff;\"><b>선이란 선</b></span>은 다<b><span style=\"color: #2f9d27;\"> &quot;산접기&quot;</span></b> 를 합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FE57345EFDA1E513\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FE57345EFDA1E513\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">짜잔. <b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">완성</span></b> 뒤집겠습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B877345EFDA1E61A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B877345EFDA1E61A\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">오홋! <b><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #ff5e00;\">산소원자 1개</span></b> ㅋ 뭐가 될까요..</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9928153E5EFDA1E619\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9928153E5EFDA1E619\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #1fafda;\">물분자</span></b> 되겠습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996E4E3E5EFDA1E623\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996E4E3E5EFDA1E623\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #66e8ff;\"><b>이산화탄소분자</b></span>도 되구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D6F83E5EFDA1E607\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D6F83E5EFDA1E607\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">허접한, <span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #a8c40d;\"><b>암모니아</b></span>....ㅋㅋ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F3233E5EFDA1E720\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F3233E5EFDA1E720\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #009999;\">정사면체</span></b>를 만들려 애써봅니다. 메테인!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아이들 모두 <b><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #ff0000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">일어나서</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #980000; background-color: #ff0000;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&quot;물분자!&quot;</span></b></span> 외침과 동시에 완성한 학생은 <span style=\"color: #ff5e00;\"><b>앉습니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">순서대로 앉으면서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff007f;\"><b>꼴지</b></span>를 찾....;;; 습니다. 긴장감 있겠지요. ^^</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아직 해보진 않았습니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">코로나가, 생각보다 기네요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>ㅠㅅㅠ 선생님들, 모두모두 힘내세요.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(ㅠㅅㅠ)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">여유가 좀 더 있다면, <b><u>각도</u></b>도 표현하고 싶.....습니다.....;;;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999E2A3E5F092F8631\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999E2A3E5F092F8631\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991949375EFDA8651D\" data-file-name=\"A4로분자모형만들기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"14848\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D302%26fileid%3D30%26regdt%3D20200702180952&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcfile%2Fcafe%2F991949375EFDA8651D')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">A4로분자모형만들기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">14.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}